title: First T-shirt
---
body:

Knitting is definitely a slippery slope into all sort of other crafts! I've been noodling around with sewing my own clothes for years, but now that I'm a knitter it doesn't seem so intimidating to learn, and I suddenly have a lot more friends that can help me get started.

A couple folks from the craft club I host got together to sew T-shirts. M was our mentor - she's been sewing for 5 years and has made dozens of pieces of clothing for herself. K has some experience sewing, and I haven't done it since a class in high school.



